  "overview": "Siemens iX — Dark (#2D2D45) canvas, Courier New typography, #00eaff brand accent, and 8px corner geometry",
  "dos": "- **Surface & Theme Polarity**: Dark (#2D2D45) canvas paired with `#2D2D45` component surfaces and `#FFFFFF` primary ink.\n- **Brand & Interactive Accent**: Primary actions and focus states anchor on `#00eaff` with `#000000` label contrast.\n- **Typographic Voice**: Headings and UI controls set in `Courier New` across 13 type steps.\n- **Component Geometry**: Buttons (`8px`), cards (`12px`), inputs, badges, and navigation bars share consistent spacing and border contrast."
